Recall: ~98% recall@10 with sensible parameters (M=16, ef_construction=200, ef_search=100, int8 quantization with rerank). This is competitive with the best vector databases.

Update behavior: HNSW pages are immutable. Updates create new versions in newer files. Compaction eventually consolidates. This means recently-updated vectors might be in multiple files until compaction. Query layer queries all files and merges. Slight read amplification on update-heavy workloads.

