Compaction strategy. How files merge over time. Tiered vs. leveled vs. hybrid. Rebuilding indexes during compaction. Compaction triggers. This directly affects the read path's file count and thus performance.
Buffer pool / page cache. How we cache pages of mixed types with intelligent eviction.
Catalog and schema layer. What CREATE TABLE looks like with vectors/edges/embedded-models declared. Schema evolution mechanics.
Query plan IR and cost model. Logical and physical operators, cardinality estimation, hybrid scoring.
Execution engine. Vectorized execution, push vs. pull, how vector search composes with hash joins.
