Full EXPLAIN ANALYZE output
Parameter values (sanitized for sensitive types)
System state at execution (CPU load, memory pressure, concurrent queries)

Slow query log is the primary debugging tool when "something is slow." Users grep through it, find the query patterns causing pain, optimize.
Format: JSON lines, rotated by size/time. Or shipped to external systems via OTel.
