EXPLAIN with PLAN, ANALYZE, VERBOSE, JSON modes; shows estimated vs actual, strategy choices, per-operator stats
Multi-modal-specific EXPLAIN: HNSW layer traversals, file pruning, recall estimates, selectivity stats
