Aggregated query history via _system.query_stats (pg_stat_statements equivalent)
Prometheus metrics on HTTP endpoint with standard naming conventions
OpenTelemetry tracing with configurable sampling (1% normal, 100% slow/error)
Trace context propagation for external API calls
All internal state introspectable as _system.* SQL tables
