Distribution — the v2 architecture story. Read replicas, distributed writes, sharding, consensus, multi-region.

This is the big one. Everything we've designed has been single-node-first by deliberate choice. Distribution changes some assumptions and we should be explicit about which ones.
This is also where the system becomes properly cloud-native and where ambitious customers' scale ceilings are removed. It's worth doing right.
